outh China, Collaborative Innovation Center for Cancer Medicine, Guangzhou, China."}]}}, {"fullName": "Mao R", "lastName": "Mao", "firstName": "Rushuang", "initials": "R", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3925-5679"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Ultrasound, Sun Yat-Sen University Cancer Center, State Key Laboratory of Oncology in South China, Collaborative Innovation Center for Cancer Medicine, Guangzhou, China."}]}}, {"fullName": "Li F", "lastName": "Li", "firstName": "Fei", "initials": "F", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8329-0899"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Ultrasound, Sun Yat-Sen University Cancer Center, State Key Laboratory of Oncology in South China, Collaborative Innovation Center for Cancer Medicine, Guangzhou, China."}]}}, {"fullName": "Xiao Y", "lastName": "Xiao", "firstName": "Yang", "initials": "Y", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Paul C. Lauterbur Research Center for Biomedical Imaging, Institute of Biomedical and Health Engineering, Shenzhen Institutes of Advanced Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Shenzhen, China."}]}}, {"fullName": "Wang Y", "lastName": "Wang", "firstName": "Yuanyuan", "initials": "Y", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Electronic Engineering, Fudan University, Shanghai, China."}, {"affiliation": "The key laboratory of medical imaging computing and computer assisted intervention of Shanghai, Shanghai, China."}]}}, {"fullName": "Hu Y", "lastName": "Hu", "firstName": "Yixin", "initials": "Y", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Ultrasound, Sun Yat-Sen University Cancer Center, State Key Laboratory of Oncology in South China, Collaborative Innovation Center for Cancer Medicine, Guangzhou, China."}]}}, {"fullName": "Yu J", "lastName": "Yu", "firstName": "Jinhua", "initials": "J", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-0654-6034"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Electronic Engineering, Fudan University, Shanghai, China. jhyu@fudan.edu.cn."}, {"affiliation": "The key laboratory of medical imaging computing and computer assisted intervention of Shanghai, Shanghai, China. jhyu@fudan.edu.cn."}]}}, {"fullName": "Zhou J", "lastName": "Zhou", "firstName": "Jianhua", "initials": "J", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-2096-8126"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Ultrasound, Sun Yat-Sen University Cancer Center, State Key Laboratory of Oncology in South China, Collaborative Innovation Center for Cancer Medicine, Guangzhou, China. zhoujh@sysucc.org.cn."}]}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8329-0899"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-0654-6034"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-1413-0987"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-3296-3421"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-4890-9665"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-1386-7052"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-2096-8126"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3925-5679"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics", "supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "1", "volume": "11", "journalIssueId": 2918979, "dateOfPublication": "2020 Mar", "monthOfPublication": 3, "yearOfPublication": 2020, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Nat Commun", "title": "Nature communications", "essn": "2041-1723", "issn": "2041-1723", "nlmid": "101528555", "isoabbreviation": "Nat Commun"}, "printPublicationDate": "2020-03-01"}, "pubYear": "2020", "pageInfo": "1236", "abstractText": "Accurate identification of axillary lymph node (ALN) involvement in patients with early-stage breast cancer is important for determining appropriate axillary treatment options and therefore avoiding unnecessary axillary surgery and complications. Here, we report deep learning radiomics (DLR) of conventional ultrasound and shear wave elastography of breast cancer for predicting ALN status preoperatively in patients with early-stage breast cancer. Clinical parameter combined DLR yields the best diagnostic performance in predicting ALN status between disease-free axilla and any axillary metastasis with areas under the receiver operating characteristic curve (AUC) of 0.902 (95% confidence interval [CI]: 0.843, 0.961) in the test cohort. This clinical parameter combined DLR can also discriminate between low and heavy metastatic burden of axillary disease with AUC of 0.905 (95% CI: 0.814, 0.996) in the test cohort. Our study offers a noninvasive imaging biomarker to predict the metastatic extent of ALN for patients with early-stage breast cancer.", "affiliation": "Department of Ultrasound, Sun Yat-Sen University Cancer Center, State Key Laboratory of Oncology in South China, Collaborative Innovation Center for Cancer Medicine, Guangzhou, China.", "publicationStatus": "epublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't", "research-article", "Journal Article"]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Breast", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "DG", "qualifierName": "diagnostic imaging"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "PA", "qualifierName": "pathology"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "SU", "qualifierName": "surgery"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Axilla"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Lymph Nodes", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "PA", "qualifierName": "pathology"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "SU", "qualifierName": "surgery"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Humans"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descrip